     --pp      uses the _p_o_l_l command to request full routing information from
             ggaatteedd.  This is an undocumented extension RIP protocol supported
             only by ggaatteedd.

     --11      queries using RIP version 1 instead of RIP version 2.

     --ww _t_i_m_e_o_u_t
